<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Hartford said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Hartford said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs raised its rating on ITT Hartford Group Inc to trading buy from market outperform, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 54-1/8 on Wednesday and were indicated higher at Thursday's open.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
